{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14508","headline":"建中癸亥岁奉天除夜宿武当山北茅平村 · 戴叔伦","name":"建中癸亥岁奉天除夜宿武当山北茅平村","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁除日又暮，山险路仍新。\n驱传迷深谷，瞻星记北辰。\n古亭聊假寐，中夜忽逢人。\n相问皆呜咽，伤心不待春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}